        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sulphur hexafluoride, liquid, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sulphur hexafluoride, liquid, at plant
About 80% of the produced amount is used for SF6 insulated electrical installations and switchgear manufacturers. The magnesium industry uses 5% of the total production. ;
CAS number: 002551-62-4; 
UUID: b1ff97f2-2364-3290-86c7-d513fd4be2e9
Production of SF6 from fluorine and sulphur. Infrastructure estimated with generic data. No data for energy use.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Burning of sulphur in a stream of fluorine
Time period: Time of publication
Production volume: 8500 t in 1997
Sampling: Literature survey 
Extrapolations: From single data.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b1ff97f2-2364-3290-86c7-d513fd4be2e9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
